# Integrals

Indefinite integrals get a constant of integration.

$$ \int \sin^2 x \, dx = ? $$

$$ \int x e^x \, dx = ? $$

$$ \int \frac{1}{x^2 + 1} \, dx = ? $$

Definite integrals give a number:

$$ \int_0^1 x^2 \, dx = ? $$

$$ \int_0^{\pi} \sin x \, dx = ? $$

$$ \int_1^e \ln x \, dx = ? $$

Ask for a decimal answer by writing `≈ ?` instead of `= ?`:

$$ \int_0^1 e^{-x^2} \, dx \approx ? $$
